  "abstract": "We continue our study of the degree of the colored Jones polyn omial under knot cabling started in [8]. Under certain hypothesis on thi s degree, we determine how the Jones slopes and the linear term behave under cabling. As an application we verify Garoufalidis\u2019 Slope Conjecture and a conjecture of [8] for c ables of a two-parameter family of closed 3-braids called 2-fusion knots.",
